      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HELLFIGHTER (1) has the strongest recent platform, coming back from CL1 company after a third at Queanbeyan where he was beaten just under a length as a short odds-on favourite. His Wagga second before that, beaten a nose on heavy ground, keeps the form line solid and this looks a suitable maiden for him to convert consistency into a win. MOROSINI (8) is lightly raced and has more scope than most, with a Canberra third two back and a fair sixth behind last start when beaten two and a half lengths. Drawn inside and out in trip for the first time. Open to plenty of improvement. REVEILLON (6) has to be included on her recent runs despite being a long-time maiden. Placed at this trip previously. Can put her best foot forward. ISOTROPIC (5) backs up quickly from Wagga, where she was beaten 3.3L. Her Queanbeyan placing stacks up through and she can feature. ICON DREAM (4) can improve with the run under her belt.",
